  "persistsDynamicCursor": false,
  "claimBoundary": "TRAMA is repository/control-plane engineering evidence. It cannot redefine product/runtime/legal truth, self-award Enterprise Candidate, close E3/E4 rails, prove representative-human usability, production effectiveness, security of a deployment, legal compliance or formal global minimality.",
